{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/4660c98789e9f9bdb222d7234877fa03.avif?t=1774457719\" width=436 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know how you ended up in this experiment.<br>You don\u2019t know why you were chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you were told is this:<br><strong>Complete the experiment, get paid, and leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of you stands an elevator.<br>And <strong>8 floors</strong> you must pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top, and it will all be over.<br>At least\u2026 that\u2019s what they told you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/2df75039e5f78d5e854f56aa36e1f77b.avif?t=1774457719\" width=303 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elevator is the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each floor, you are given a short moment to observe.<br>Does everything look normal?<br>Or is something wrong?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the floor appears <strong>completely clean</strong>, press the <i>SAFE</i> button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice <strong>any movement, anomaly, or potential threat</strong>, return to the elevator and press the <i>DANGER</i> button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single wrong decision can reset your progress.<br>Correct judgments are the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not test your reflexes.<br>It tests your <strong>perception and attention to detail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/a3575127221b4b96fbf236fc67a1986e.avif?t=1774457719\" width=389 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not end in a single playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different decision paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing all achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proving your speed and earning a place on the <strong>leaderboard</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Exit 8, this is a short yet intense <strong>surreal psychological horror</strong> experience focused on perception and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers an immersive experience lasting approximately <strong>60 to 120 minutes or more</strong>, depending on exploration and replayability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135540?t=1774457719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/73f9bff51ef678e62cc5d9d7c11a4c6e8c29b8ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774457719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/ffe809911fda8c746413b107431b0b5c236e4110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774457719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/ffe809911fda8c746413b107431b0b5c236e4110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774457719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may be disturbing to some players.\r\nIt contains graphic depictions of blood, themes of psychological distress, unsettling imagery, and atmospheric sound design."},"demos":[{"appid":4447930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/4660c98789e9f9bdb222d7234877fa03.avif?t=1774457719\" width=436 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know how you ended up in this experiment.<br>You don\u2019t know why you were chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you were told is this:<br><strong>Complete the experiment, get paid, and leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of you stands an elevator.<br>And <strong>8 floors</strong> you must pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the top, and it will all be over.<br>At least\u2026 that\u2019s what they told you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/2df75039e5f78d5e854f56aa36e1f77b.avif?t=1774457719\" width=303 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elevator is the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each floor, you are given a short moment to observe.<br>Does everything look normal?<br>Or is something wrong?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the floor appears <strong>completely clean</strong>, press the <i>SAFE</i> button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice <strong>any movement, anomaly, or potential threat</strong>, return to the elevator and press the <i>DANGER</i> button</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single wrong decision can reset your progress.<br>Correct judgments are the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not test your reflexes.<br>It tests your <strong>perception and attention to detail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/extras/a3575127221b4b96fbf236fc67a1986e.avif?t=1774457719\" width=389 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not end in a single playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different decision paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing all achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proving your speed and earning a place on the <strong>leaderboard</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by The Exit 8, this is a short yet intense <strong>surreal psychological horror</strong> experience focused on perception and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers an immersive experience lasting approximately <strong>60 to 120 minutes or more</strong>, depending on exploration and replayability.</p>","developers":["Echo Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135540/ecb3382f3f8022311c36b1bd53a3b8bed29b07eb/header.jpg?t=1774457719","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135540/970987149/9e2a7759257eeac76b1845581bf9a350c52807e4/1773763529/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773767821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135540/970987149/9e2a7759257eeac76b1845581bf9a350c52807e4/1773763529/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773767821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135540/970987149/9e2a7759257eeac76b1845581bf9a350c52807e4/1773763529/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773767821