ator. Observe each floor carefully, separate reality from anomalies, and make the right decisions to reach the top and escape.","steam_appid":4135540,"support_info":{"email":"feechoforge@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}